--- (D) E[c_k] general: per-subset sums, k=3,5,7 ---
    uniform per-subset baseline = (k-1)!/2^k; E[c_k](n) is a degree-k poly in n
  k=3: uniform per-subset E = 1/4 (= (k-1)!/2^k)
    E[c3](n) = n=3:1/2, n=4:3/2, n=5:13/4, n=6:6, n=7:10
    polynomial fit:
    degree 3; Newton coeffs (forward diffs at n=3): [Fraction(1, 2), Fraction(1, 1), Fraction(3, 4), Fraction(1, 4)]
    closed form: c3-var/ck poly in n = 1/24*n^3 + -1/8*n^2 + 1/3*n + -1/2
    (verified poly matches all data points)
  k=5: uniform per-subset E = 3/4 (= (k-1)!/2^k)
    E[c5](n) = n=5:19/16, n=6:49/8, n=7:315/16, n=8:199/4, n=9:1727/16, n=10:1683/8, n=11:6055/16
    polynomial fit:
    degree 5; Newton coeffs (forward diffs at n=5): [Fraction(19, 16), Fraction(79, 16), Fraction(69, 8), Fraction(63, 8), Fraction(15, 4), Fraction(3, 4)]
    closed form: c3-var/ck poly in n = 1/160*n^5 + -1/16*n^4 + 9/32*n^3 + -7/8*n^2 + 147/80*n + -7/4
    (verified poly matches all data points)
  k=7: uniform per-subset E = 45/8 (= (k-1)!/2^k)
    E[c7](n) = n=7:499/64, n=8:1837/32, n=9:15663/64, n=10:12571/16, n=11:134555/64, n=12:158187/32, n=13:674719/64, n=14:166591/8, n=15:2474019/64
    polynomial fit:
    degree 7; Newton coeffs (forward diffs at n=7): [Fraction(499, 64), Fraction(3175, 64), Fraction(4407, 32), Fraction(6909, 32), Fraction(825, 4), Fraction(120, 1), Fraction(315, 8), Fraction(45, 8)]
    closed form: c3-var/ck poly in n = 1/896*n^7 + -3/128*n^6 + 27/128*n^5 + -145/128*n^4 + 137/32*n^3 + -751/64*n^2 + 9229/448*n + -543/32
    (verified poly matches all data points)

